# Shell scripts must keep LF endings. `core.autocrlf=true` is normal on the Windows
# machines this project is built on, and a CRLF shebang makes Git Bash refuse to run
# a script at all ("bad interpreter") — for the ones run by hand (`tool/*.sh`) and
# for the ones CI runs (`.github/workflows/qa-*.yml` call `tool/qa_capture.sh`).
*.sh text eol=lf
